  description="The terms governing your use of AI Betting Tips: informational content only, no guarantee of winnings, affiliate disclosure and liability limits."
  active="">

  <div class="container">
    <div class="page-head">
      <div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Terms of Use</div>
      <h1>Terms of <em>use</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">By using this website you agree to these terms. Please read them carefully — especially the parts about risk and the absence of any guarantee of winnings.</p>
