      <div class="note"><strong>Template notice:</strong> these terms are a practical starting point for an affiliate content site. Review them — and the governing-law section in particular — with a professional before you rely on them.</div>

      <h2>1. Acceptance</h2>
      <p>These Terms of Use govern your access to and use of ai-betting-tips.com (the “Site”), operated by an independent publisher (“we”, “us”). Registered company details will appear here once a legal entity is incorporated. If you do not agree with these terms, please do not use the Site.</p>

