      <p>We have commercial affiliate relationships with some of the bookmakers, casinos and other operators featured on the Site. If you follow a link and register or deposit, we may receive a commission at no additional cost to you. These relationships do not influence our editorial scores, which are based on fixed criteria. Links to partners are marked accordingly.</p>

      <h2>5. Third-party sites and offers</h2>
      <p>The Site links to third-party operators. We do not control and are not responsible for their content, odds, bonuses, terms or availability. Bonus offers change frequently and are subject to the operator's own terms and conditions, including wagering requirements and country restrictions. Always check the offer details on the operator's site before signing up.</p>

      <h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>The Site's design, text, graphics and original data compilations are owned by us or our licensors and are protected by law. You may view and share content for personal, non-commercial use, but you may not copy, republish or exploit it commercially without our written permission.</p>

      <h2>7. Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>You agree not to misuse the Site — for example by attempting to disrupt it, scrape it at scale, introduce malicious code, or use it for any unlawful purpose.</p>

      <h2>8. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>The Site is provided “as is” and “as available”, without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. To the fullest extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any losses — including gambling losses — arising from your use of, or reliance on, the Site or any operator linked from it.</p>

      <h2>9. Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update the Site and these terms at any time. Continued use after changes are posted means you accept the updated terms.</p>

